      <description>&lt;p&gt;RStudio’s mission is:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;“To equip everyone, regardless of means, to participate in a global economy that rewards data literacy.”&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
